1
00:00:14,350 --> 00:00:19,790
I was standing in the quiet watching shadows softly breathe

2
00:00:19,790 --> 00:00:25,620
Those unspoken wishes like a mystery

3
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:31,080
Every step feels bigger than but a crowd is all to me

4
00:00:32,430 --> 00:00:37,460
I don't know who is waiting there but I'll let it be

5
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:40,940
If I fall, I die before

6
00:00:41,650 --> 00:00:44,240
If I break, let there be light

7
00:00:44,890 --> 00:00:47,110
There's a world behind the fear

8
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:50,270
So it can make me feel alive

9
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:53,490
Seeing a storm start to avoid

10
00:00:53,490 --> 00:00:56,310
Showing the miracle we made

11
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:59,270
This time we're about to fly

12
00:00:59,270 --> 00:01:02,590
No more fending, drifting by

13
00:01:02,590 --> 00:01:05,020
We keep moving

14
00:01:05,810 --> 00:01:08,730
We keep it when I'm standing still

15
00:01:08,730 --> 00:01:11,770
I'm not losing

16
00:01:11,770 --> 00:01:14,930
You and your song we're writing still

17
00:01:14,930 --> 00:01:17,850
Knowing the ending

18
00:01:17,850 --> 00:01:20,990
I know I don't need to see the proof

19
00:01:20,990 --> 00:01:23,260
The sign is lightening up

20
00:01:25,250 --> 00:01:28,820
Like he's calling me to you

21
00:01:45,710 --> 00:01:49,470
I remember all the versions

22
00:01:49,470 --> 00:01:52,300
Some are lonely, some are ill or still

23
00:01:53,510 --> 00:01:55,590
No more running away

24
00:01:55,590 --> 00:01:58,250
Just hearing echoes afar

25
00:01:58,250 --> 00:02:01,080
If the future is a puzzle

26
00:02:01,470 --> 00:02:04,190
I am brave enough to solve it

27
00:02:04,190 --> 00:02:07,030
If the end is just a journey

28
00:02:07,030 --> 00:02:09,980
I'll be ready for the call

29
00:02:10,470 --> 00:02:12,860
If I fall, I can be far

30
00:02:13,290 --> 00:02:15,890
If I break, let there be light

31
00:02:15,890 --> 00:02:18,830
There's a world behind the fear

32
00:02:18,830 --> 00:02:22,070
So it can make me feel alive

33
00:02:22,070 --> 00:02:24,940
We keep moving

34
00:02:25,430 --> 00:02:28,330
We keep it when I'm standing still

35
00:02:28,330 --> 00:02:31,230
I'm not losing

36
00:02:31,230 --> 00:02:34,150
You left me somewhere right still

37
00:02:34,150 --> 00:02:37,230
Knowing the ending

38
00:02:37,230 --> 00:02:40,410
I know I don't need to see it through

39
00:02:40,410 --> 00:02:42,470
I'm silent right now

40
00:02:42,470 --> 00:02:44,850
He's calling me to you

41
00:02:44,850 --> 00:02:47,770
I can feel it pushing on me

42
00:02:47,770 --> 00:02:50,930
Up when the sky, he falls on top of me

43
00:02:50,930 --> 00:02:56,820
I don't look back, I only take the ugly for a new one now

44
00:03:07,710 --> 00:03:10,360
We keep moving

45
00:03:11,290 --> 00:03:14,090
We keep it wet and I'm standing still

46
00:03:14,090 --> 00:03:20,070
I'm not losing you, I'm somewhere right still

47
00:03:20,070 --> 00:03:26,290
Knowing the ending, I know I don't need to see it through

48
00:03:26,290 --> 00:03:31,470
I'm signing this line up, signing this line up

49
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:34,020
He's calling me to you

